# Authentication with ExAzure

```elixir
Mix.install([
  {:ex_azure, path: "."},
  {:req, "~> 0.5"},
  {:sweet_xml, "~> 0.7"},
  {:telemetry, "~> 1.3"}
])
```

## Shared Key

```elixir
shared_key =
  ExAzure.Identity.SharedKeyCredential.new(
    "devstoreaccount1",
    "Eby8vdM02xNOcqFlqUwJPLlmEtlCDXJ1OUzFT50uSRZ6IFsuFq2UVErCz4I6tq/K1SZFPTOtr/KBHBeksoGMGw=="
  )

client =
  ExAzure.Storage.Client.new(
    account: "devstoreaccount1",
    credential: shared_key,
    endpoint: "http://127.0.0.1:10000/devstoreaccount1"
  )

{:ok, containers} = ExAzure.Storage.Container.list(client)
length(containers)
```

## SAS credential

```elixir
# SAS tokens are applied as query parameters by ExAzure.Pipeline.SAS
sas = ExAzure.Identity.SASCredential.new("sv=2021-06-08&ss=b&srt=sco&sp=rwdlacup&se=2030-01-01T00:00:00Z&sig=example")
sas.params["sv"]
```
